  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering and nurturing leadership skills of youth through climate action education in Uzbekistan- 01004355</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project addresses the critical development challenge of building climate resilience and promoting sustainable, low-carbon lifestyles among the youth in Uzbekistan, with a particular focus on rural communities. Uzbekistan, characterized by its continental climate and vulnerable to the impacts of climate change, faces significant environmental challenges, including increasing temperatures, frequent droughts, and desertification exacerbated by the drying Aral Sea. These environmental challenges</narrative>
  </description>
